{"4177620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lost Soul", "steam_appid": 4177620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost Soul is a short, atmospheric, third person, puzzle game that focuses on music. Play as Lost Soul and wander four unique maps to find various notes, conversation topics, beautiful vistas, and solve various puzzles while following the story of Lost Soul and this strange fae.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lost soul is a ghost that is corrupted by demon magic. This Lost Soul is a ghost so corrupted that it no longer even remembers its name nor what it used to be... but it does remember one thing. A song. Torn in half, thoughts on one side and heart on the other with an intense hunger for other souls, Lost Soul longs to return back to its original ending; silence and peace. Before it can do that though Lost Soul will need to catch that strange fae first.    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Four Unique Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every area has its own story, notes, and puzzles to find. From sunset cliffside vistas, to strange eternal rivers, to swampy labyrinths, to that tall tower in the distance; every place is unique. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177620/extras/0863899f74044fc9340ab25da0999cfe.poster.avif?t=1786563773\" width=700 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177620/extras/0863899f74044fc9340ab25da0999cfe.webm?t=1786563773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration, Notes, and Conversations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While exploring there are tons of things to come across, including beautiful vistas to admire, scraps of notes, and even conversations between the characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177620/extras/6e6d5447dcdcb162eb1fc4bf54f96441.avif?t=1786563773\" width=500 height=281 /></span>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Music based puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and solve various types of puzzles including music based puzzles to move forward and to learn a little more about the world, sometimes even Lost Soul themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177620/extras/cf672a1b448d3d7c19474019f405f2f2.poster.avif?t=1786563773\" width=800 height=528 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177620/extras/cf672a1b448d3d7c19474019f405f2f2.webm?t=1786563773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177620/extras/cf672a1b448d3d7c19474019f405f2f2.mp4?t=1786563773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost Soul is a short, atmospheric, third person, puzzle game that focuses on music. Play as Lost Soul and wander four unique maps to find various notes, conversation topics, beautiful vistas, and solve various puzzles while following the story of Lost Soul and this strange fae.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lost soul is a ghost that is corrupted by demon magic. This Lost Soul is a ghost so corrupted that it no longer even remembers its name nor what it used to be... but it does remember one thing. A song. Torn in half, thoughts on one side and heart on the other with an intense hunger for other souls, Lost Soul longs to return back to its original ending; silence and peace. Before it can do that though Lost Soul will need to catch that strange fae first.    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Four Unique Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every area has its own story, notes, and puzzles to find. From sunset cliffside vistas, to strange eternal rivers, to swampy labyrinths, to that tall tower in the distance; every place is unique. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177620/extras/0863899f74044fc9340ab25da0999cfe.poster.avif?t=1786563773\" width=700 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177620/extras/0863899f74044fc9340ab25da0999cfe.webm?t=1786563773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration, Notes, and Conversations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While exploring there are tons of things to come across, including beautiful vistas to admire, scraps of notes, and even conversations between the characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177620/extras/6e6d5447dcdcb162eb1fc4bf54f96441.avif?t=1786563773\" width=500 height=281 /></span>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Music based puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and solve various types of puzzles including music based puzzles to move forward and to learn a little more about the world, sometimes even Lost Soul themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177620/extras/cf672a1b448d3d7c19474019f405f2f2.poster.avif?t=1786563773\" width=800 height=528 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177620/extras/cf672a1b448d3d7c19474019f405f2f2.webm?t=1786563773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177620/extras/cf672a1b448d3d7c19474019f405f2f2.mp4?t=1786563773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Follow the story of Lost Soul, a corrupted spirit with only one memory left. Explore the ruins of a sealed fae village. Solve music focused puzzles, find notes left behind, and experience lively conversation with unexpected company along the way. Because even a lost soul can still hear music.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177620/db6ddab0f76537576cec51752507684303cd4f42/header.jpg?t=1786563773", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177620/e97218058283b0c4ee203e81f98e0351ff90a852/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786563773", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177620/e97218058283b0c4ee203e81f98e0351ff90a852/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786563773", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core Intel or AMD, 2.5 GHz or faster<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 960 GTX